{"4204240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Liar's Lift", "steam_appid": 4204240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Liar's Lift — a party game for 3–8 players</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4204240/extras/4573dbeb5f86c4bffb3d340d9f537b0a.avif?t=1775767835\" alt=\"\"width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a derelict elevator shaft. You cannot see the other players. Your only link to the world is a rusty, distorted intercom. In this claustrophobic descent, information is your only currency. Speak clearly, but listen even closer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4204240/extras/78c4d0c2ad5a13c32f114ebb37b75a7a.avif?t=1775767835\" alt=\"\"width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive 12 floors of psychological warfare. From deducing hidden identities to managing critical weight limits and cutting high-voltage cables. Work together to solve the puzzles, or sabotage the group to secure your own victory. Every floor is a new test of wit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4204240/extras/6fadc2f00b34489e0cabbf2ebbc0363a.avif?t=1775767835\" alt=\"\"width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no fair rules in a falling lift. Form fragile alliances to advance, or choose a darker path: bluff, manipulate, and betray. In Liar's Lift, cooperation might save the group, but greed is what opens the doors for the winner.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Liar's Lift — a party game for 3–8 players</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4204240/extras/4573dbeb5f86c4bffb3d340d9f537b0a.avif?t=1775767835\" alt=\"\"width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a derelict elevator shaft. You cannot see the other players. Your only link to the world is a rusty, distorted intercom. In this claustrophobic descent, information is your only currency. Speak clearly, but listen even closer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4204240/extras/78c4d0c2ad5a13c32f114ebb37b75a7a.avif?t=1775767835\" alt=\"\"width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive 12 floors of psychological warfare. From deducing hidden identities to managing critical weight limits and cutting high-voltage cables. Work together to solve the puzzles, or sabotage the group to secure your own victory. Every floor is a new test of wit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4204240/extras/6fadc2f00b34489e0cabbf2ebbc0363a.avif?t=1775767835\" alt=\"\"width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no fair rules in a falling lift. Form fragile alliances to advance, or choose a darker path: bluff, manipulate, and betray. In Liar's Lift, cooperation might save the group, but greed is what opens the doors for the winner.</p>", "short_description": "Liar's Lift is a 3-8 player social competition. Use the elevator's emergency phone to communicate and solve challenges. Lie or play fair to earn points across multiple rounds. No one dies, but only one winner exits. In this lift, your reputation is the only thing at stake.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4204240/8d8a88935f6ea67f82a6d5f85698330185a9759a/header.jpg?t=1775767835", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4204240/efdc03e500574259605793d543a945891bc383d6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775767835", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4204240/efdc03e500574259605793d543a945891bc383d6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775767835", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4170 or AMD FX-8120<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 460 o AMD Radeon HD 5870 (1 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4670K or AMD Ryzen 5 1500X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti o AMD Radeon RX 570 (2 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Rydan"], "publishers": ["Rydan"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 9, "des